=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with Crochepallade at (H-9).
* He will provide you with a {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} and 5 {i:Blank fiend plates|Blank F. Plate|19205}.
* The {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} will not work if you under the effect of {s:Sneak} or {p:Invisible (Status)} or too far away.
* Take pictures of different {p:Orcs|Category:Orc}. {p:Campaign Battle|Category:Campaign Battle} mobs are valid. Picture must be taken from the front of the mob, she will not accept pictures from the back or side of the mob.
* Each picture you take will create a {i:Fiend Plate|Fiend Plate|2560} with the mob's name on it and take up an inventory slot. The exposed {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} do not stack.
* Return to Crochepallade and trade him one {i:Fiend Plate|Fiend Plate|2560} at a time.
* After he accepts 3 {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} the mission is complete.
* Unused {i:Blank Fiend Plates|Blank F. Plate|19205} may be utilized for {p:Deep Cover III (S)}.

=2 Notes
* The {z:Jugner Forest (S)} {p:Survival Guide} has at least five different {p:Orcs|Category:Orc} nearby without even zoning into {z:La Vaule (S)}.

